API descriptions (specs/)
-------------------------
The files in specs/ are a machine-readable snapshot of the public API
documentation published at https://apidoc.sweb.ru (an OpenRPC-style document
per API object). They are generated by scripts/sync_specs.py, which extracts
the embedded OpenRPC documents from the documentation site's JavaScript
bundle. The snapshot is committed so that the server works out of the box;
refreshing it is a deliberate, reviewable step. These files describe a public
API interface, not SpaceWeb source code. If the rights holder objects to this
redistribution, the snapshot will be removed from the repository on request.

Extraction logic
----------------
The spec extraction approach (locating `JSON.parse("...")` documents in the
docs bundle) and the initial snapshot were adapted from the MIT-licensed
project:

  sanchpet/sweb-go-sdk - https://github.com/sanchpet/sweb-go-sdk
  Copyright (c) its authors, licensed under the MIT License.

No source code of that project is vendored here; the Python implementation in
scripts/sync_specs.py was written for this project.

